WEBVTT

01:38.140 --> 01:41.070
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.140 --> 01:43.990
[Episode 17]

01:44.330 --> 01:49.130
[Outside Shendu City]

01:52.870 --> 01:53.229
Sir,

01:54.200 --> 01:55.259
have a seat inside.

02:01.430 --> 02:03.490
Chief Constable Chu, you're so fast.

02:08.840 --> 02:10.240
Why are you following me?

02:10.520 --> 02:11.030
What?

02:11.680 --> 02:13.190
Is this road owned by you?

02:13.280 --> 02:14.810
You can walk it, but I can't?

02:16.710 --> 02:18.310
Fine, follow me all you want.

02:19.000 --> 02:19.710
I'm not going back

02:19.710 --> 02:21.240
with you to see your mother.

02:21.240 --> 02:22.500
If you've got the guts,

02:22.710 --> 02:24.640
follow me all the way to Guangping.

02:24.680 --> 02:26.630
Take the order, Chief Constable Chu Youhuang of Guangping.

02:26.630 --> 02:27.560
What order?

02:29.960 --> 02:31.960
This is Lord Song's personal token.

02:32.000 --> 02:32.840
This token

02:33.120 --> 02:34.579
represents His Lordship.

02:37.430 --> 02:39.690
Are you going to take his order like that?

02:43.280 --> 02:44.740
My Lord, anything you say.

02:46.880 --> 02:47.910
Lord Song has ordered me to investigate

02:47.910 --> 02:49.590
the case of Lord Xin'an's disappearance.

02:49.590 --> 02:50.960
I've chosen you as my assistant.

02:50.960 --> 02:52.560
The official dispatch has been issued

02:52.560 --> 02:54.430
and can reach Guangping in two days.

02:54.430 --> 02:56.090
You don't need to report back.

02:56.800 --> 02:58.260
You're coming with me now.

03:05.240 --> 03:06.570
Wait, that's not right.

03:07.280 --> 03:08.680
Lord Xin'an went missing

03:08.800 --> 03:10.240
many years ago.

03:13.000 --> 03:13.900
The paper demon

03:15.240 --> 03:16.800
might be related to this case.

03:16.800 --> 03:17.400
Moreover,

03:17.840 --> 03:19.840
Lord Xin'an is His Majesty's uncle,

03:19.960 --> 03:21.960
royal by blood with distinguished status.

03:21.960 --> 03:22.910
Now that he's missing,

03:22.910 --> 03:24.560
we have to find him at any cost.

03:24.560 --> 03:26.090
Do you have any objections?

03:26.680 --> 03:27.610
I wouldn't dare.

03:28.240 --> 03:29.710
Good. If not,

03:30.840 --> 03:31.840
let's get moving.

03:32.280 --> 03:33.340
Where are we going?

03:34.840 --> 03:35.970
Back to the capital.

03:36.750 --> 03:37.560
Didn't Lord Xin'an go missing

03:37.560 --> 03:39.690
in the Underground City of Guangping?

03:39.710 --> 03:41.660
To investigate, we first need leads.

03:41.660 --> 03:43.150
Lord Xin'an is from Shendu.

03:43.150 --> 03:44.470
We're heading there now

03:44.470 --> 03:45.800
to visit someone who knows him

03:45.800 --> 03:46.800
for more details.

03:47.240 --> 03:48.150
And who's that?

03:50.640 --> 03:51.270
My mother.

04:00.190 --> 04:00.710
Master,

04:01.280 --> 04:02.470
we've been searching for so long

04:02.470 --> 04:03.560
and finally found a rabbit demon

04:03.560 --> 04:04.590
hiding over there.

04:04.590 --> 04:05.310
Why did we

04:05.310 --> 04:06.370
let it go so easily?

04:07.430 --> 04:08.960
Because of Ganshan Clinic.

04:09.750 --> 04:11.410
We're in the same line of work.

04:11.590 --> 04:12.920
I shouldn't interfere.

04:14.080 --> 04:15.430
A lowly demon

04:16.040 --> 04:17.240
isn't worth the fuss.

04:19.170 --> 04:21.360
Why alert them unnecessarily?

04:30.800 --> 04:31.310
Master,

04:32.240 --> 04:33.240
that cup of tea...

04:33.390 --> 04:35.270
These past few days, I've been observing the sky.

04:35.270 --> 04:37.120
The night has devoured the Big Dipper,

04:37.120 --> 04:38.920
its handle pointing southeast.

04:41.190 --> 04:41.750
Today,

04:42.800 --> 04:44.330
an honored guest will come.

04:48.830 --> 04:49.270
Sir,

04:49.310 --> 04:51.170
this young lady is here to see you.

05:01.920 --> 05:02.720
Father,

05:03.070 --> 05:03.830
this time,

05:04.390 --> 05:06.120
I can't stand by and do nothing.

05:07.270 --> 05:07.870
Tomorrow,

05:08.310 --> 05:09.800
I'll go to the Underground City.

05:09.800 --> 05:11.720
I hope you won't blame me

05:12.560 --> 05:14.070
for going back on my word.

05:36.040 --> 05:36.630
Banxia.

05:38.430 --> 05:39.000
Banxia?

05:40.920 --> 05:41.780
Physician Jiu,

05:42.270 --> 05:43.200
long time no see.

05:43.480 --> 05:45.080
Are you here to see Miss Duan?

05:46.159 --> 05:46.630
Yes.

05:47.159 --> 05:48.760
She left early this morning.

05:49.560 --> 05:50.360
She did?

05:51.159 --> 05:52.090
Where did she go?

05:52.920 --> 05:53.650
I don't know.

05:54.240 --> 05:55.140
She carried a bag on her back

05:55.140 --> 05:56.500
and left with her maid.

06:05.870 --> 06:06.930
Hurry up, hurry up!

06:07.360 --> 06:08.390
Be careful when you put it down!

06:08.390 --> 06:09.190
Don't drop it!

06:10.190 --> 06:10.720
Hurry up!

06:12.630 --> 06:14.030
What are you two here for?

06:14.430 --> 06:15.920
We're going to the Underground City.

06:15.920 --> 06:17.380
Do you have the pass token?

06:23.750 --> 06:24.950
Please wait a moment.

06:25.480 --> 06:26.120
Hurry up.

06:56.600 --> 07:01.330
[Wugeng Inn, Underground City]

07:00.070 --> 07:00.670
Miss Duan,

07:00.720 --> 07:02.040
please wait here for now.

07:02.040 --> 07:03.040
We'll go ask around.

07:03.040 --> 07:03.870
If there's any news,

07:03.870 --> 07:05.270
we'll come back and let you know.

07:05.270 --> 07:06.510
Let me go with you.

07:06.630 --> 07:08.210
There are all kinds of people in the Underground City.

07:08.210 --> 07:10.360
It'd be inconvenient to bring you along.

07:10.360 --> 07:11.690
You'd better wait here.

07:14.830 --> 07:15.630
Thank you.

07:29.160 --> 07:29.830
My Lady,

07:30.480 --> 07:32.310
is it day or night now?

07:33.270 --> 07:34.930
It should be nighttime by now.

07:38.000 --> 07:38.800
But

07:39.700 --> 07:41.760
that boat ride didn't last very long.

07:43.270 --> 07:44.159
Are we still

07:44.159 --> 07:45.420
under Guangping City?

07:46.920 --> 07:47.630
I think so.

07:49.810 --> 07:50.780
When we got here,

07:50.810 --> 07:52.310
I found this place familiar.

07:52.310 --> 07:53.640
And looking around now,

07:53.920 --> 07:55.510
I think I really have been here before.

07:55.510 --> 07:56.909
You've been here before?

07:58.570 --> 07:59.720
Do you remember I told you

07:59.720 --> 08:00.530
I was kidnapped

08:00.530 --> 08:01.600
when I was little?

08:04.680 --> 08:05.680
It was during that time

08:05.680 --> 08:06.740
that I met Manying.

08:08.920 --> 08:10.120
You met him here?

08:14.000 --> 08:14.600
Mr. Lyu,

08:14.920 --> 08:15.920
your goods have arrived.

08:15.920 --> 08:16.520
Thank you.

08:16.830 --> 08:17.360
Let's go.

08:17.800 --> 08:18.800
Check the shipment.

08:18.800 --> 08:19.240
Yes.

08:27.920 --> 08:30.280
[Lyu Chunmian, manager of Xiaodongtian]

08:43.870 --> 08:44.670
What's wrong?

08:45.390 --> 08:46.120
Since I got here,

08:46.120 --> 08:46.480
I...

08:46.790 --> 08:48.850
I can smell the scent of a snake demon.

08:49.150 --> 08:50.240
I'm scared to go in.

08:52.120 --> 08:53.780
Then how did you get in before?

08:55.150 --> 08:56.320
Back then…

08:56.790 --> 08:57.850
I just came this far

08:58.320 --> 08:59.510
and then turned back.

08:59.510 --> 09:00.200
Gentlemen,

09:01.270 --> 09:02.630
I'm Lyu Chunmian.

09:02.970 --> 09:04.120
I run a small business

09:04.120 --> 09:05.240
here in the Underground City.

09:05.240 --> 09:06.030
May I ask

09:06.240 --> 09:07.150
your names?

09:09.510 --> 09:10.510
My surname is Jiu.

09:10.790 --> 09:11.790
My name is Chi Xue.

09:12.320 --> 09:12.910
Jiu,

09:13.600 --> 09:14.410
looks like

09:14.430 --> 09:15.910
it's your first time here.

09:16.550 --> 09:17.910
If you don't mind,

09:18.030 --> 09:18.690
I'd be happy

09:18.750 --> 09:19.880
to guide you around.

09:26.030 --> 09:27.630
Thank you for your kindness.

09:27.910 --> 09:28.840
You're welcome.

09:34.440 --> 09:35.000
Xuanye,

09:35.600 --> 09:36.860
there are murals here.

09:37.600 --> 09:39.180
This one depicts Yu carving through Mount Longmen.

09:39.180 --> 09:40.200
Legend has it that in ancient times,

09:40.200 --> 09:41.360
floods were rampant.

09:41.360 --> 09:42.960
The ruler then, Yu the Great,

09:42.960 --> 09:44.150
vowed to control the floods,

09:44.150 --> 09:45.440
but Mount Longmen was in his way,

09:45.440 --> 09:46.280
so he led his people

09:46.280 --> 09:47.390
to carve through it to release the floodwaters.

09:47.390 --> 09:48.360
They carved through the eastern and western mountains

09:48.360 --> 09:49.510
and redirected the Yi River.

09:49.510 --> 09:50.550
After 13 years,

09:50.790 --> 09:52.790
he finally completed this mission.

09:53.240 --> 09:55.080
Up ahead there's also Yu Gong moving mountains,

09:55.080 --> 09:56.120
Kua Fu chasing the sun,

09:56.120 --> 09:57.440
Jingwei filling the sea,

09:57.440 --> 09:58.450
and Nüwa mending the sky,

09:58.450 --> 09:59.640
all familiar tales

09:59.670 --> 10:00.600
from mythology.

10:02.210 --> 10:03.090
Sir, do you know

10:03.120 --> 10:04.090
who painted

10:04.120 --> 10:05.120
these murals?

10:05.720 --> 10:06.720
That I don't know.

10:07.120 --> 10:08.600
The Underground City is ancient,

10:08.600 --> 10:09.930
and no one knows for sure

10:10.000 --> 10:10.870
who built it.

10:12.910 --> 10:14.940
These murals look so vivid in color.

10:15.360 --> 10:16.030
In a damp place

10:16.030 --> 10:16.910
like this,

10:17.440 --> 10:19.080
they're still well-preserved.

10:19.080 --> 10:20.600
They don't seem like ancient works.

10:20.600 --> 10:21.320
They're likely

10:21.320 --> 10:22.510
more recent

10:23.080 --> 10:24.600
and probably not done

10:25.120 --> 10:27.180
by the same people who built the city.

10:30.010 --> 10:31.270
Whoever painted them,

10:31.480 --> 10:32.540
they chose stories

10:32.600 --> 10:33.510
about defiance,

10:33.510 --> 10:34.670
refusing to surrender to fate,

10:34.670 --> 10:35.840
and fighting against nature.

10:35.840 --> 10:36.720
That alone

10:37.440 --> 10:39.100
says a lot about their spirit.

10:39.670 --> 10:41.530
You've got a sharp eye, my friend.

10:41.910 --> 10:42.440
This way.

10:43.550 --> 10:48.400
[Underground City]

10:51.440 --> 10:53.550
The Underground City may seem ordinary,

10:53.550 --> 10:55.080
but it can bleed people dry.

10:55.150 --> 10:56.120
Since it's your first time here,

10:56.120 --> 10:57.580
you must be extra careful.

10:57.910 --> 10:59.370
Thank you for the warning.

10:59.910 --> 11:00.470
Jiu,

11:01.150 --> 11:02.440
I feel like we hit it off at first sight.

11:02.440 --> 11:03.970
Care to grab a drink with me?

11:05.080 --> 11:06.560
We have important matters to attend to,

11:06.560 --> 11:07.490
so I have to pass.

11:08.360 --> 11:09.390
That's a shame.

11:10.910 --> 11:13.240
Thank you for answering all our questions along the way.

11:13.240 --> 11:15.670
It's nothing—just words, not worth mentioning.

11:15.670 --> 11:16.480
Farewell, then.

11:16.480 --> 11:17.230
Farewell.

11:18.120 --> 11:18.840
Come on, Chi Xue.

11:18.840 --> 11:19.370
Let's go.

11:34.150 --> 11:34.910
Xuanye.

11:35.670 --> 11:37.530
Where are we going to find Banxia?

11:38.270 --> 11:38.870
Excuse me,

11:39.270 --> 11:40.120
are you two…

11:40.910 --> 11:42.110
looking for someone?

11:42.340 --> 11:44.400
[Song Qi, a local guide]

11:42.510 --> 11:44.720
I'm Song Qi, a local guide in the Underground City.

11:44.720 --> 11:47.440
I'm at your service.

11:54.910 --> 11:56.720
No need to be nervous.

11:57.440 --> 11:58.700
I'm not a bad guy.

11:59.030 --> 11:59.790
Look.

12:00.640 --> 12:02.290
I'm certified by all 18 trade guilds

12:02.050 --> 12:03.980
[Guide]

12:02.320 --> 12:03.960
as a local guide.

12:04.320 --> 12:05.750
I have a sterling reputation here

12:05.750 --> 12:08.010
for knowing everything about everyone.

12:08.440 --> 12:09.030
I'm here

12:09.030 --> 12:10.910
to serve distinguished guests

12:10.910 --> 12:11.720
like the two of you.

12:11.720 --> 12:12.720
So, what do you say?

12:12.720 --> 12:13.450
Interested?

12:14.630 --> 12:15.200
Xuanye.

12:16.030 --> 12:17.960
He doesn't look like a good person.

12:18.630 --> 12:19.890
I don't want any money.

12:21.080 --> 12:22.410
Maybe he's not that bad.

12:23.370 --> 12:25.030
You have a good eye, young man.

12:27.510 --> 12:28.030
Chi Xue.

12:28.340 --> 12:28.870
Let's go.

12:29.080 --> 12:29.610
Alright.

12:33.550 --> 12:35.430
Please don't worry, sirs.

12:35.960 --> 12:36.790
Not just me,

12:37.310 --> 12:38.150
but every local guide

12:38.150 --> 12:39.480
in the Underground City

12:39.510 --> 12:41.120
is forbidden from

12:41.120 --> 12:42.320
charging travelers.

12:42.390 --> 12:43.390
That's a rule set

12:43.410 --> 12:44.510
by the 18 trade guilds.

12:44.510 --> 12:45.870
No one dares to break it.

12:46.870 --> 12:48.200
So if you don't take money,

12:48.200 --> 12:49.530
how do you make a living?

12:49.910 --> 12:51.870
We local guides work under the guilds.

12:51.870 --> 12:53.470
We receive a monthly salary.

12:54.720 --> 12:55.320
But…

12:55.960 --> 12:56.550
if a traveler

12:56.550 --> 12:58.570
happens to notice

12:58.600 --> 13:00.390
our dry lips

13:01.200 --> 13:02.200
and offers a tip for drinks,

13:02.200 --> 13:04.460
we're not prohibited from accepting it.

13:05.840 --> 13:07.370
Then we'll be in your hands.

13:13.280 --> 13:20.630
[Xiaodongtian]

13:13.790 --> 13:14.450
Here we are.

13:15.320 --> 13:16.380
Please, go inside.

13:19.670 --> 13:20.870
What is this place?

13:21.200 --> 13:21.600
This is

13:21.600 --> 13:22.910
what I mentioned earlier—

13:22.910 --> 13:24.360
Xiaodongtian.

13:24.840 --> 13:26.090
It's one of

13:26.120 --> 13:27.030
the most well-known

13:27.030 --> 13:28.910
18 stores in the Underground City.

13:28.910 --> 13:30.570
Mainly, it operates as a bank.

13:30.750 --> 13:31.800
According to city regulations here,

13:31.800 --> 13:33.410
all merchants and travelers

13:33.670 --> 13:34.650
who come through here

13:34.650 --> 13:36.240
must stop by Xiaodongtian first

13:36.240 --> 13:37.570
to exchange their money

13:38.040 --> 13:38.970
for trade notes.

13:39.910 --> 13:40.790
So…

13:41.320 --> 13:43.590
all transactions in the Underground City

13:43.590 --> 13:45.310
use trade notes?

13:45.960 --> 13:46.790
Exactly.

13:49.110 --> 13:49.770
Gentlemen.

13:52.870 --> 13:53.790
Wait here a moment

13:53.790 --> 13:55.520
and take a short rest.

13:55.750 --> 13:57.200
I'll go get us a number.

14:22.640 --> 14:23.440
Thanks.

14:23.440 --> 14:23.770
Okay.

14:25.510 --> 14:26.440
Just a moment.

14:26.600 --> 14:27.660
It won't take long.

14:32.110 --> 14:32.910
What's wrong?

14:33.510 --> 14:34.080
Nothing.

14:43.360 --> 14:44.020
Gentlemen.

14:44.320 --> 14:45.030
Gentlemen,

14:45.650 --> 14:47.720
do you really have no money?

14:48.910 --> 14:49.840
You're holding this bundle

14:49.840 --> 14:50.670
so tightly.

14:51.320 --> 14:52.600
There must be something valuable inside.

14:52.600 --> 14:53.910
It might be worth some money.

14:53.910 --> 14:54.880
Just take it out

14:54.910 --> 14:56.640
so you can get more trade notes.

14:59.550 --> 15:00.680
That's more like it.

15:00.840 --> 15:01.600
You...

15:02.750 --> 15:04.280
T-These are valuable here?

15:06.630 --> 15:08.790
That's what you've been guarding from me

15:08.790 --> 15:09.790
the whole way?

15:10.810 --> 15:11.660
Well, yeah.

15:11.920 --> 15:13.780
You may want to steal my radishes.

15:18.270 --> 15:18.960
Thank you.

15:27.000 --> 15:28.000
This way, please.

15:35.270 --> 15:35.930
Here we are.

15:36.150 --> 15:36.870
This

15:36.870 --> 15:38.600
is the cheapest room in our inn.

15:38.630 --> 15:40.600
There's a basin inside for washing up.

15:40.600 --> 15:42.320
You can get water from the vat over here.

15:42.320 --> 15:43.510
Lights go out at midnight.

15:43.510 --> 15:44.840
Meals are not included.

15:46.670 --> 15:47.330
Gentlemen,

15:47.910 --> 15:48.840
we don't usually

15:48.840 --> 15:49.910
put honored guests

15:49.910 --> 15:50.840
in this room.

15:51.270 --> 15:52.550
Please don't touch anything

15:52.550 --> 15:53.750
in the room.

15:57.000 --> 15:57.660
Gentlemen,

15:58.170 --> 15:59.100
have a good rest.

16:27.320 --> 16:27.870
Xuanye.

16:29.600 --> 16:31.000
It's damp and noisy here.

16:31.440 --> 16:33.440
There's even a noodle stall right outside.

16:33.440 --> 16:34.570
And these blankets…

16:36.120 --> 16:36.790
How could they

16:36.790 --> 16:38.190
put us in a room like this?

16:41.000 --> 16:41.510
Chi Xue,

16:42.390 --> 16:43.450
let's bear with it.

16:43.720 --> 16:44.850
Let's tidy up first,

16:45.150 --> 16:46.080
and then we'll go

16:46.510 --> 16:47.440
look for Banxia.

16:50.960 --> 16:51.360
Shan.

16:51.910 --> 16:52.510
Who was it?

16:54.390 --> 16:55.050
Never mind.

16:56.410 --> 16:57.610
Just two more paupers

16:57.750 --> 16:58.600
checking in.

17:04.690 --> 17:08.060
[Xiang Shan, swordsman]

17:04.690 --> 17:08.060
[Xiang Feng, swordsman]

17:05.480 --> 17:06.339
Where's Third?

17:06.920 --> 17:08.000
He went out for something.

17:08.000 --> 17:09.130
He'll be back later.

17:11.400 --> 17:12.920
Come on,

17:13.640 --> 17:14.500
lay the map out.

17:15.030 --> 17:17.310
Let's go over it again carefully.

17:19.640 --> 17:20.030
Here,

17:20.920 --> 17:21.310
here,

17:21.640 --> 17:22.000
here,

17:22.880 --> 17:23.510
and here—

17:24.460 --> 17:25.280
we've searched

17:25.280 --> 17:26.520
all of these places.

17:27.310 --> 17:28.000
Shan,

17:28.240 --> 17:28.960
we've been searching

17:28.960 --> 17:29.850
for so long,

17:29.880 --> 17:31.000
but we haven't found

17:31.000 --> 17:31.830
even a trace of Lord Xin'an.

17:31.830 --> 17:33.200
Are we looking in the wrong place?

17:33.200 --> 17:34.400
That's impossible!

17:35.880 --> 17:37.110
We must've

17:37.110 --> 17:38.170
missed something.

17:44.640 --> 17:45.270
Shan,

17:45.750 --> 17:47.680
we moved from the third floor to the second,

17:47.680 --> 17:48.740
and now we're here.

17:49.200 --> 17:49.790
If we still can't find anything,

17:49.790 --> 17:52.590
the three of us might end up sleeping on the street.

17:53.370 --> 17:54.970
I've been starving for days.

18:04.550 --> 18:06.350
You've been in Guangping for so long,

18:06.350 --> 18:08.760
but you've never been to the Underground City?

18:08.760 --> 18:10.070
You grew up in Shendu,

18:10.510 --> 18:12.880
but you've never seen the Twelve Golden Statues?

18:12.880 --> 18:13.680
I have.

18:15.110 --> 18:16.510
There are no such things.

18:16.880 --> 18:18.340
Then why ask me about them?

18:19.790 --> 18:20.790
I was just asking.

18:21.270 --> 18:24.930
Just because you haven't seen them doesn't mean they don't exist.

18:27.200 --> 18:27.800
Excuse me.

18:28.270 --> 18:29.000
I heard

18:29.000 --> 18:30.260
you're looking for me?

18:31.200 --> 18:32.430
We're looking for the best

18:32.430 --> 18:34.490
local guide in the Underground City.

18:34.590 --> 18:35.520
That would be me.

18:37.720 --> 18:38.270
Really?

18:39.270 --> 18:40.440
Absolutely!

18:40.720 --> 18:42.000
You can ask around.

18:42.110 --> 18:43.130
I'm the best

18:43.160 --> 18:44.510
local guide in the Underground City.

18:44.510 --> 18:45.510
My name is Song Qi.

18:45.730 --> 18:48.060
[Song Qi, eloquent and smooth-talking]

18:48.830 --> 18:49.750
I can swear on

18:49.750 --> 18:51.430
my savings at Xiaodongtian.

18:53.750 --> 18:54.610
Do you have any?

18:56.720 --> 18:59.070
Well, whether I have any or not,

18:59.200 --> 19:00.240
if you want me

19:00.580 --> 19:01.880
to do something for you,

19:01.880 --> 19:03.510
I can definitely get it done.

19:10.310 --> 19:11.880
In the autumn of the sixth year of the Tianxiang Era,

19:11.880 --> 19:13.300
this man came to the Underground City

19:13.300 --> 19:14.310
with an old servant.

19:14.310 --> 19:15.680
Then he disappeared.

19:16.200 --> 19:17.400
He was in his forties,

19:17.640 --> 19:18.680
of noble status,

19:18.680 --> 19:20.030
and generous with his money.

19:20.030 --> 19:21.430
The servant, though old,

19:21.720 --> 19:22.920
was highly skilled in martial arts

19:22.920 --> 19:24.920
and had plenty of experience in the martial world.

19:24.920 --> 19:26.450
They may have used aliases—

19:26.510 --> 19:28.170
possibly surnamed Bai or Wei.

19:31.680 --> 19:32.680
Here's a deposit.

19:43.240 --> 19:44.300
Within three days,

19:44.440 --> 19:45.270
if you bring us

19:45.270 --> 19:46.510
any information about him,

19:46.510 --> 19:47.910
we'll double the reward.

19:50.290 --> 19:51.220
Wait for my news.

19:56.590 --> 19:58.450
Why do you trust someone like him?

19:58.720 --> 19:59.550
He knows this place.

19:59.550 --> 20:01.480
He's got a better chance of finding him than we do.

20:01.480 --> 20:02.880
Aren't you afraid he'll take the money and run?

20:02.880 --> 20:03.940
If he runs, let him.

20:04.070 --> 20:06.470
It's not like I care about that bit of money.

20:08.550 --> 20:10.160
The way you throw money around—

20:10.160 --> 20:12.360
you really are your mother's daughter.

20:13.880 --> 20:14.590
Thank you

20:14.590 --> 20:16.230
for that heartfelt comment on her.

20:16.230 --> 20:17.220
I'll be sure to pass it along.

20:17.220 --> 20:17.850
No need.

20:23.150 --> 20:25.140
[Wu Qun]

20:27.310 --> 20:27.910
Excuse me,

20:28.640 --> 20:29.410
I'm Ma San,

20:29.680 --> 20:31.270
a local guide in the Underground City.

20:31.270 --> 20:32.070
How can I

20:32.070 --> 20:32.830
help you two?

20:33.640 --> 20:34.510
We're looking for

20:34.510 --> 20:37.040
the best local guide in the Underground City.

20:38.720 --> 20:39.650
That would be me.

20:45.940 --> 20:47.160
In the autumn of the sixth year of the Tianxiang Era,

20:47.160 --> 20:48.590
this man came to the Underground City

20:48.590 --> 20:49.720
with an old servant.

20:49.750 --> 20:51.070
Then he disappeared.

20:51.680 --> 20:52.940
He was of noble status…

20:59.680 --> 21:00.940
My Lady, food's ready.

21:01.790 --> 21:03.650
It's been two whole days already,

21:03.920 --> 21:05.450
and still not a word.

21:06.230 --> 21:06.860
My Lady,

21:08.130 --> 21:09.020
do you think

21:09.250 --> 21:10.550
those two are sincerely

21:10.550 --> 21:11.550
trying to help us?

21:14.120 --> 21:15.490
They asked about

21:15.510 --> 21:16.630
Ganshan Clinic the whole way.

21:16.630 --> 21:18.170
Once we said we didn't know Physician Jiu that well,

21:18.170 --> 21:20.300
their attitude changed immediately.

21:20.400 --> 21:22.600
But Xuanye told me before

21:23.040 --> 21:24.770
they really are demon hunters.

21:25.180 --> 21:26.460
Yeah, but not all

21:26.660 --> 21:28.190
demon hunters are the same.

21:29.160 --> 21:30.010
Even Kongtongzi claimed

21:30.010 --> 21:31.080
to be one.

21:34.590 --> 21:35.640
I feel like

21:36.440 --> 21:37.790
those two aren't that invested

21:37.790 --> 21:38.590
in helping us.

21:40.200 --> 21:42.660
Then maybe we should try looking ourselves?

21:42.830 --> 21:43.680
Sure.

21:44.920 --> 21:46.580
The Enlightenment Bookstore

21:46.610 --> 21:48.130
is a store.

21:48.640 --> 21:49.880
The Underground City is big,

21:49.880 --> 21:51.800
but if we look shop by shop,

21:52.020 --> 21:53.480
we'll find it eventually.

21:54.750 --> 21:55.490
Come on, eat up.

21:55.490 --> 21:56.690
We'll go right after.

22:07.720 --> 22:09.240
You two are right on time.

22:10.000 --> 22:10.960
In the past couple of days,

22:10.960 --> 22:11.590
you must've met

22:11.590 --> 22:13.050
quite a few people, right?

22:13.350 --> 22:14.290
Am I the first one

22:14.310 --> 22:16.260
to bring you any news?

22:16.640 --> 22:17.270
You are.

22:17.720 --> 22:19.480
You've proven through action

22:19.550 --> 22:21.010
that you truly are the best

22:21.030 --> 22:23.030
local guide in the Underground City.

22:23.030 --> 22:23.790
Madam,

22:23.790 --> 22:25.160
you flatter me.

22:25.550 --> 22:27.310
Actually, the man you're looking for—

22:27.310 --> 22:28.240
I know about him.

22:28.640 --> 22:29.690
In the past few years,

22:29.690 --> 22:31.350
many people have come to the Underground City

22:31.350 --> 22:32.210
to look for him.

22:32.300 --> 22:34.210
But none of them found anything.

22:38.310 --> 22:38.880
Sir, madam,

22:38.880 --> 22:40.140
please look this way.

22:41.680 --> 22:42.280
This place

22:42.440 --> 22:44.200
is the residence

22:44.200 --> 22:46.260
of the great physician, Huangfu Bai.

22:46.800 --> 22:47.990
The person you're looking for

22:47.990 --> 22:50.190
came to the Underground City to see him.

22:50.920 --> 22:51.380
Let me tell you.

22:51.380 --> 22:52.660
Huangfu Bai

22:52.880 --> 22:54.010
is quite eccentric.

22:54.240 --> 22:56.100
He only sees three patients a day.

22:56.510 --> 22:57.550
I spent the past two days

22:57.550 --> 22:59.030
pulling strings

22:59.030 --> 23:00.110
to get you a spot on his schedule,

23:00.110 --> 23:00.510
or I'd have

23:00.510 --> 23:02.240
brought you here much earlier.

23:10.000 --> 23:10.930
It's right here.

23:19.950 --> 23:20.550
Thank you.

23:21.310 --> 23:21.940
We may need

23:22.310 --> 23:23.680
your help again in the future.

23:23.680 --> 23:25.060
You're welcome.

23:25.400 --> 23:26.880
Let me know if you need anything.

23:26.880 --> 23:28.640
I won't go in with you then.

23:29.740 --> 23:30.340
Take care.

23:30.790 --> 23:31.390
Take care.

23:34.750 --> 23:36.860
We don't even know if this is true or not,

23:36.860 --> 23:38.460
yet you gave him money again.

23:39.980 --> 23:41.110
You don't trust him?

23:41.790 --> 23:42.990
Or you don't trust me?

23:43.790 --> 23:45.250
Mainly, I don't trust you.

23:49.620 --> 23:55.970
[Clinic]

24:09.920 --> 24:10.680
Anyone here?

24:12.480 --> 24:12.940
Anyone…

24:18.480 --> 24:19.340
Close the door.

24:35.020 --> 24:36.160
Turn around.

24:42.160 --> 24:43.070
I see two people

24:43.090 --> 24:44.540
in perfect health

24:45.000 --> 24:46.200
without any illness.

24:46.680 --> 24:48.010
What are you doing here?

24:49.480 --> 24:50.880
Sir, you have a sharp eye.

24:51.110 --> 24:53.170
We're not here for a medical consult.

24:53.180 --> 24:55.030
No matter what you're here for,

24:55.490 --> 24:57.820
the consultation fee is non-refundable.

24:57.900 --> 24:58.580
Of course.

25:02.070 --> 25:02.870
Two years ago,

25:03.240 --> 25:04.830
this man came here with an old servant

25:04.830 --> 25:06.160
to seek your treatment.

25:06.240 --> 25:07.510
Do you remember him?

25:10.280 --> 25:11.540
Who are you guys to him?

25:12.870 --> 25:13.600
To be honest,

25:14.350 --> 25:16.550
we're constables from the Court of Judicial Review.

25:16.550 --> 25:17.160
This man

25:17.440 --> 25:19.190
is the emperor's uncle,

25:19.400 --> 25:20.130
Lord Xin'an.

25:20.550 --> 25:21.510
Two years ago,

25:21.550 --> 25:23.160
he came to the Underground City in disguise

25:23.160 --> 25:24.680
and disappeared soon after.

25:24.680 --> 25:25.940
We're here to find him.

25:26.870 --> 25:27.850
I advise you

25:27.870 --> 25:28.800
to stop looking.

25:29.440 --> 25:29.920
Why?

25:33.640 --> 25:34.860
Even if you find him,

25:35.480 --> 25:37.750
he's probably long dead.

25:40.310 --> 25:41.640
What makes you say that?

25:42.350 --> 25:44.830
He was suffering from a blood-related illness.

25:44.830 --> 25:45.870
When he came to me,

25:46.000 --> 25:47.690
his condition was already beyond saving.

25:47.690 --> 25:51.020
By my estimation, he wouldn't have lived more than 100 days.

25:54.400 --> 25:55.400
I've gone through

25:55.400 --> 25:57.000
a lot of files on Lord Xin'an.

25:57.160 --> 25:58.370
None of them mention

25:58.400 --> 25:59.730
any incurable disease.

26:00.160 --> 26:01.350
The royal palace has skilled physicians.

26:01.350 --> 26:03.480
None of them ever mentioned he was ill.

26:03.710 --> 26:04.670
If those quacks

26:04.690 --> 26:05.870
could've cured him,

26:05.900 --> 26:07.430
he wouldn't have come to me.

26:07.480 --> 26:08.410
Unfortunately,

26:08.480 --> 26:09.590
he came too late.

26:10.130 --> 26:11.730
There was nothing I could do.

26:12.780 --> 26:13.580
Thief!

26:14.350 --> 26:15.540
Thief, don't run!

26:15.870 --> 26:16.730
-Stop!
-Thief!

26:17.160 --> 26:18.440
Stop right there!

26:20.790 --> 26:21.960
Where are you from, little thief?

26:21.960 --> 26:23.600
How dare you break the rules of the Underground City

26:23.600 --> 26:24.720
and steal from others?

26:24.720 --> 26:26.050
Do you have a death wish?

26:33.160 --> 26:33.640
Miss,

26:34.200 --> 26:35.600
is this your money pouch?

26:35.710 --> 26:36.270
Yes, yes.

26:38.270 --> 26:39.130
Thank you, sir.

26:39.440 --> 26:40.550
You're welcome.

26:41.590 --> 26:42.200
But

26:42.200 --> 26:43.200
carrying this much silver around

26:43.200 --> 26:44.400
is really dangerous.

26:44.550 --> 26:45.400
Next time,

26:45.550 --> 26:46.950
go to Xiaodongtian first

26:47.350 --> 26:48.480
and exchange your silver

26:48.480 --> 26:49.410
for trade notes.

26:49.550 --> 26:51.880
That way, no one can steal from you, got it?

26:52.590 --> 26:53.310
We're new here

26:53.310 --> 26:54.880
and aren't familiar with the rules.

26:54.880 --> 26:56.110
That's okay.

26:56.510 --> 26:58.660
Just make sure you find someone to show you around, okay?

26:58.660 --> 26:59.720
Miss,

27:00.070 --> 27:01.270
are you here for business,

27:01.270 --> 27:02.590
shopping, or looking for someone?

27:02.590 --> 27:03.680
We're looking for someone.

27:03.680 --> 27:05.540
Then you've met the right person!

27:05.830 --> 27:06.490
I am

27:06.800 --> 27:09.370
Song Qi, a local guide in the Underground City.

27:09.370 --> 27:11.830
I know everything and everyone around here.

27:12.270 --> 27:13.790
No matter who you're looking for,

27:13.790 --> 27:14.830
I can help you.

27:15.160 --> 27:15.840
Really?

27:15.960 --> 27:16.750
Of course.

27:17.720 --> 27:18.520
No, thank you.

27:18.950 --> 27:20.730
We'll look on our own.

27:20.880 --> 27:22.080
Thanks for the offer.

27:22.440 --> 27:23.240
My Lady,

27:23.790 --> 27:26.010
we've made inquiries along two streets,

27:26.010 --> 27:26.930
but no one knows

27:26.960 --> 27:28.400
where the Enlightenment Bookstore is.

27:28.400 --> 27:30.130
The Enlightenment Bookstore?

27:32.200 --> 27:33.550
I haven't heard of that.

27:33.830 --> 27:34.270
But

27:34.270 --> 27:35.830
I can ask around for you.

27:36.350 --> 27:37.510
Really, it's not necessary.

27:37.510 --> 27:38.240
Thank you.

27:38.440 --> 27:39.440
We can find it ourselves.

27:39.440 --> 27:40.040
Thank you.

27:41.400 --> 27:41.830
I...

27:42.750 --> 27:43.960
Be careful!

27:51.060 --> 27:51.920
What are you looking at?

27:51.920 --> 27:52.790
Didn't you see me coming out?

27:52.790 --> 27:54.250
Why didn't you step aside?

27:56.910 --> 27:58.320
What's that awful smell?

27:58.960 --> 28:00.290
Is it just my nose,

28:00.790 --> 28:01.360
or did you eat

28:01.360 --> 28:02.420
something rotten?

28:03.590 --> 28:06.050
-Are you looking for a beating, punk?
-Feng!

28:06.870 --> 28:07.440
Shan,

28:07.750 --> 28:08.610
he insulted me.

28:11.960 --> 28:13.160
Don't cause trouble.

28:15.200 --> 28:15.930
Boy,

28:16.750 --> 28:17.720
what do you do?

28:19.550 --> 28:20.680
What I do

28:20.800 --> 28:22.130
is none of your concern.

28:23.880 --> 28:25.010
Here's some advice:

28:25.720 --> 28:27.110
when you speak to someone,

28:27.110 --> 28:28.350
think twice

28:28.600 --> 28:30.530
before acting like you're top dog.

28:31.110 --> 28:31.590
Exactly.

28:31.590 --> 28:32.590
That's not smart.

28:32.680 --> 28:34.810
You'll easily get taken advantage of.

28:36.200 --> 28:37.520
In this world,

28:37.680 --> 28:40.080
the most important thing is knowing your place.

28:40.080 --> 28:40.760
Sometimes,

28:40.790 --> 28:42.310
bowing down to someone

28:42.440 --> 28:43.370
isn't shameful.

28:46.340 --> 28:47.620
Keep daydreaming.

28:49.200 --> 28:49.720
Shan.

28:49.750 --> 28:50.990
What kind of attitude is that?

28:50.990 --> 28:52.450
I'll... I'll beat them up.

28:54.030 --> 28:55.030
Coward.

28:56.510 --> 28:57.000
Master,

28:57.480 --> 28:59.110
those two girls aren't at the inn.

28:59.110 --> 29:00.340
Where could they have gone?

29:00.340 --> 29:01.750
Maybe they didn't see us return

29:01.750 --> 29:03.480
and went to search on their own.

29:03.830 --> 29:05.030
Those two young girls

29:05.350 --> 29:06.850
are completely defenseless.

29:06.850 --> 29:08.050
Will they be alright?

29:08.550 --> 29:09.550
The Underground City has been

29:09.550 --> 29:10.440
cleaned up a lot over the years.

29:10.440 --> 29:12.100
It's not as chaotic as before.

29:12.160 --> 29:12.690
However,

29:12.920 --> 29:15.120
we need to find them as soon as possible.

29:15.160 --> 29:15.720
Master,

29:15.920 --> 29:18.200
are you really going to help her find her parents?

29:18.200 --> 29:20.370
I've taken her money, so I must do the job.

29:20.370 --> 29:21.850
Without her pass token,

29:21.920 --> 29:24.580
we couldn't have entered the Underground City.

29:24.880 --> 29:25.990
I saw it those days.

29:26.500 --> 29:27.680
They were very close to that boy

29:27.680 --> 29:29.070
from the Eight Pillar Sect.

29:29.070 --> 29:31.730
Yet they lied to us, saying they didn't know him.

29:32.030 --> 29:32.630
Disciple,

29:33.110 --> 29:34.590
in the end, we have the same goal.

29:34.590 --> 29:35.560
It was just a misunderstanding.

29:35.560 --> 29:37.450
Don't hold a grudge over it.

29:38.070 --> 29:38.740
I want nothing to do with people

29:38.740 --> 29:40.940
who can't even tell demons from humans.

30:11.260 --> 30:12.350
Run! Run!

30:17.790 --> 30:18.550
Watch out!

30:35.720 --> 30:36.720
You can't escape.

30:37.640 --> 30:38.310
A demon?

30:39.180 --> 30:39.710
Yes.

30:40.140 --> 30:41.720
Xuanye was right after all.

30:41.750 --> 30:43.270
There are demons in the Underground City.

30:43.270 --> 30:45.330
We ran into one soon after we came out.

30:45.480 --> 30:46.320
But he didn't

30:46.350 --> 30:47.830
seem like a bad person.

30:48.590 --> 30:49.880
He even helped us stop the thief

30:49.880 --> 30:51.480
and get the money pouch back.

30:51.590 --> 30:53.170
Demons can be good or bad.

30:53.570 --> 30:55.300
Think about Chi Xue. He's good.

30:57.030 --> 30:58.430
So what are you afraid of?

30:59.720 --> 31:00.440
Yeah…

31:01.110 --> 31:02.440
what am I even afraid of?

31:36.680 --> 31:37.810
My Lady, be careful!

31:40.200 --> 31:41.130
Are you alright?

32:37.510 --> 32:39.440
It's that idiot who bumped into us.

32:39.810 --> 32:41.540
There's another one with them.

32:42.310 --> 32:43.140
Ignore them.

32:47.030 --> 32:47.830
There's a fight up ahead.

32:47.830 --> 32:48.620
Hurry, hurry!

32:48.620 --> 32:49.160
Wait for me!

32:49.160 --> 32:50.560
There's a fight going on.

32:52.270 --> 32:53.200
There's a fight.

32:53.720 --> 32:54.980
A fight has broken out.

33:06.960 --> 33:07.560
Miss Duan,

33:07.880 --> 33:08.740
do you know him?

33:10.920 --> 33:12.160
Then why did he save you?

33:12.160 --> 33:13.490
And why did you help him?

33:14.950 --> 33:15.820
What about you?

33:16.510 --> 33:17.970
Why did you try to hurt him?

33:18.030 --> 33:20.240
You said you can tell a demon when you see one.

33:20.240 --> 33:21.970
Then you should know what he is.

33:24.360 --> 33:26.090
Has he done anything evil?

33:27.590 --> 33:28.860
A demon is a demon.

33:28.960 --> 33:30.580
What's wrong with being a demon?

33:30.580 --> 33:33.380
Just being a demon doesn't mean he deserves to die.

33:34.590 --> 33:35.520
Ignorant woman.

33:35.920 --> 33:37.920
You've actually sided with a demon!

33:38.350 --> 33:38.960
Tell me!

33:39.270 --> 33:40.110
Do you know him?

33:40.110 --> 33:40.830
Where did he run off to?

33:40.830 --> 33:41.240
Disciple.

33:41.240 --> 33:42.030
I don't know!

33:42.310 --> 33:42.880
Tell me!

33:46.750 --> 33:47.610
Physician Jiu.

33:47.750 --> 33:48.550
You again.

33:50.070 --> 33:51.070
Do you want to die?

33:51.830 --> 33:52.680
You people from the Eight Pillar Sect

33:52.680 --> 33:54.540
have lived up to your reputation,

33:54.680 --> 33:56.080
twisting right and wrong

33:56.480 --> 33:58.740
and treating humans and demons the same.

34:01.350 --> 34:02.750
I dare you to say it again.

34:03.680 --> 34:05.000
We will meet again.

34:06.110 --> 34:06.710
Disciple.

34:07.510 --> 34:08.040
Let's go.

34:29.400 --> 34:30.600
You two wait outside.

34:31.440 --> 34:32.500
You come in with me.

34:44.960 --> 34:45.600
Why did you

34:45.620 --> 34:47.510
come to the Underground City alone?

34:47.510 --> 34:48.440
I didn't come alone.

34:48.440 --> 34:49.639
There were four of us.

34:51.630 --> 34:52.630
You mean

34:53.139 --> 34:54.199
those two just now?

34:55.840 --> 34:58.550
There were some misunderstandings between them and me.

34:58.550 --> 34:59.750
Misunderstandings?

35:00.640 --> 35:01.510
It's my business anyway.

35:01.510 --> 35:03.310
I don't want to explain it to you.

35:04.880 --> 35:05.820
For you…

35:06.070 --> 35:06.630
for you,

35:06.630 --> 35:08.090
I broke my promise to my fa…

35:10.670 --> 35:12.030
What do you take me for?

35:12.440 --> 35:14.240
I've been running around for you

35:14.240 --> 35:15.070
and doing everything I can

35:15.070 --> 35:16.730
to help you find your parents.

35:16.920 --> 35:17.550
What?

35:18.130 --> 35:18.970
You're not even across the river yet,

35:18.970 --> 35:21.170
and you're already burning the bridge?

35:23.880 --> 35:25.150
You found someone more capable than me,

35:25.150 --> 35:25.750
is that it?

35:26.440 --> 35:27.630
I just don't get it.

35:28.010 --> 35:29.410
What did I do wrong?

35:29.670 --> 35:30.120
What did I do

35:30.120 --> 35:31.320
to upset you, My Lady?

35:35.390 --> 35:36.250
Say something.

35:36.640 --> 35:37.840
Why are you being so harsh?

35:37.840 --> 35:38.510
This is

35:38.510 --> 35:39.610
my own business.

35:41.090 --> 35:41.590
Do I have to report to you

35:41.590 --> 35:42.480
wherever I go?

35:42.510 --> 35:43.910
What are we to each other?

35:49.430 --> 35:51.030
So I was just being nosy.

35:51.400 --> 35:52.510
I overstepped.

35:53.800 --> 35:55.460
You have nothing to do with me,

35:55.590 --> 35:57.390
and I have no right to interfere.

35:58.670 --> 35:59.440
I'll leave.

36:00.030 --> 36:00.690
From now on,

36:01.070 --> 36:02.330
I won't help you again.

36:06.110 --> 36:07.440
Why are you grabbing me?

36:08.860 --> 36:09.630
Let go.

36:18.110 --> 36:18.960
You're hurt?

36:20.550 --> 36:21.810
Are you still leaving?

36:25.860 --> 36:27.990
I'll leave after checking your wound.

36:31.840 --> 36:32.470
Sit down.

36:39.110 --> 36:39.840
Stop crying.

36:40.510 --> 36:42.260
You're the one being unreasonable.

36:42.260 --> 36:43.760
How am I being unreasonable?

36:43.760 --> 36:44.970
Your father told you

36:45.000 --> 36:46.320
not to come to the Underground City.

36:46.320 --> 36:47.490
Yet you insisted on coming.

36:47.490 --> 36:48.320
How old are you?

36:48.320 --> 36:49.920
Why didn't you listen to him?

36:50.880 --> 36:52.440
Don't you know why?

36:59.800 --> 37:02.060
The Underground City is very dangerous.

37:02.150 --> 37:03.230
Both you and I

37:04.030 --> 37:05.090
need to be careful.

37:05.510 --> 37:06.110
Got it?

37:07.550 --> 37:09.350
You're telling me to be careful?

37:09.910 --> 37:10.660
You nearly

37:10.680 --> 37:12.810
got into a fight on the street just now.

37:13.130 --> 37:14.660
I was trying to protect you.

37:14.880 --> 37:16.340
It was just a little shove,

37:16.360 --> 37:17.120
that's all.

37:17.150 --> 37:18.810
He was just trying to scare me,

37:18.880 --> 37:20.210
but you drew your sword.

37:31.080 --> 37:31.620
What exactly

37:31.620 --> 37:32.680
happened just now?

37:33.190 --> 37:33.920
Why did those two guys

37:33.920 --> 37:34.920
try to attack you?

37:37.030 --> 37:39.160
They were trying to hunt that man down.

37:39.670 --> 37:41.630
But he saved me once before.

37:42.150 --> 37:42.760
Moreover,

37:42.800 --> 37:43.710
to help me,

37:43.710 --> 37:45.280
he was chased down.

37:46.030 --> 37:47.960
So I knocked over the wooden barrel

37:48.550 --> 37:49.610
to help him escape.

37:52.400 --> 37:53.150
A man?

37:55.000 --> 37:55.960
A demon.

37:58.800 --> 38:00.260
Why would you help a demon?

38:01.120 --> 38:02.450
What's wrong with that?

38:02.540 --> 38:03.760
Demons' lives matter too.

38:03.760 --> 38:05.030
Besides, he helped me.

38:12.710 --> 38:13.240
Alright.

38:14.230 --> 38:16.070
Make sure to keep the wound dry.

38:21.670 --> 38:23.870
You've been searching for two days now.

38:23.920 --> 38:24.880
Any progress?

38:26.800 --> 38:27.480
What?

38:28.880 --> 38:30.610
The Enlightenment Bookstore.

38:36.960 --> 38:38.360
Then starting tomorrow,

38:38.800 --> 38:40.200
I'll help you look for it.

38:43.890 --> 38:44.530
You…

38:49.900 --> 38:50.790
Wait a moment.

38:55.630 --> 38:56.760
From now on,

38:57.200 --> 38:58.600
no matter what happens,

38:59.250 --> 39:00.780
we'll talk it through first

39:01.150 --> 39:03.080
and then make decisions together.

39:03.190 --> 39:03.800
Got it?

39:10.110 --> 39:10.590
Coming.

39:16.370 --> 39:17.430
What's the matter?

39:17.510 --> 39:18.370
I didn't knock.

39:18.590 --> 39:19.150
He did.

39:22.190 --> 39:22.820
Jiu,

39:24.020 --> 39:24.900
we meet again.

39:25.800 --> 39:27.260
My master wants to see you.

39:34.280 --> 39:36.480
A man suffering from a terminal illness

39:36.710 --> 39:39.190
traveled all the way to the Underground City,

39:39.190 --> 39:40.670
consulted a famous physician,

39:40.670 --> 39:41.630
lost hope,

39:42.410 --> 39:44.270
and disappeared without a trace.

39:48.710 --> 39:50.040
How do you explain that?

39:52.070 --> 39:53.530
There's no explaining it.

39:54.670 --> 39:55.710
So you think

39:55.710 --> 39:57.070
he simply took his own life?

39:57.070 --> 39:58.930
Or maybe he died from the illness.

39:59.190 --> 40:00.400
Either way, he's dead,

40:00.400 --> 40:01.110
nowhere to be found.

40:01.110 --> 40:02.440
It makes perfect sense.

40:02.920 --> 40:04.250
I don't think it adds up.

40:04.640 --> 40:05.500
Think about it.

40:05.700 --> 40:07.500
Lord Xin'an had a big household.

40:07.680 --> 40:08.560
He had four sons

40:08.590 --> 40:09.590
and six daughters,

40:09.590 --> 40:11.650
the youngest only four years old now.

40:11.710 --> 40:13.110
His wife had no children,

40:13.320 --> 40:14.110
but all his concubines

40:14.110 --> 40:15.270
could bear heirs.

40:15.920 --> 40:17.320
In a household like that,

40:17.810 --> 40:18.260
do you think

40:18.260 --> 40:19.590
life could be peaceful?

40:19.880 --> 40:21.030
Definitely not.

40:22.400 --> 40:23.780
After Lord Xin'an disappeared,

40:23.780 --> 40:24.710
his household fell into chaos.

40:24.710 --> 40:26.110
His sons don't get along,

40:26.360 --> 40:27.000
and things are getting worse

40:27.000 --> 40:28.030
day by day.

40:29.220 --> 40:30.470
Lord Xin'an was proud

40:30.490 --> 40:31.840
and cared deeply about his reputation.

40:31.840 --> 40:32.800
For a man like him,

40:32.800 --> 40:34.860
when he knew he had only 100 days left,

40:35.330 --> 40:36.900
would he really hide away

40:37.530 --> 40:38.150
in some unknown place

40:38.150 --> 40:39.210
and end his own life

40:39.230 --> 40:41.560
without going back to make arrangements?

40:41.840 --> 40:43.100
What are you implying?

40:44.000 --> 40:45.930
I think something happened to him.

40:48.910 --> 40:50.470
Whether he's dead or alive,

40:51.070 --> 40:52.480
we need to find out what that something was

40:52.480 --> 40:54.400
and whether someone was behind it.

40:54.400 --> 40:56.200
Then we can report to His Majesty

40:56.230 --> 40:58.090
and the Court of Judicial Review.

40:58.470 --> 41:00.190
So you really are here to look for Lord Xin'an.

41:00.190 --> 41:01.250
What did you think?

41:02.060 --> 41:03.660
That I came here just for you?

41:03.660 --> 41:04.660
I never said that.

41:06.100 --> 41:06.920
Alright, let's go.

41:06.920 --> 41:08.050
We've lost the lead,

41:08.360 --> 41:08.940
and there's still

41:08.940 --> 41:10.250
a lot we need to do.

41:13.230 --> 41:14.160
Here, take this.

41:17.320 --> 41:17.880
What for?

41:18.710 --> 41:20.370
A dagger coated in insect oil.

41:21.070 --> 41:21.870
What can it do?

41:23.280 --> 41:23.800
It was given to me

41:23.800 --> 41:25.070
by a demon hunter friend of mine.

41:25.070 --> 41:26.130
It can kill demons.

41:29.170 --> 41:30.840
The Underground City is a mixed bag.

41:30.840 --> 41:32.110
You never know when a demon might appear.

41:32.110 --> 41:33.710
Better safe than sorry.

41:35.400 --> 41:36.600
I'll just be generous

41:36.670 --> 41:38.400
and give you the insect oil too.

41:42.710 --> 41:44.110
Are you worried about me?

41:44.630 --> 41:46.360
I'm afraid you'll slow me down.

41:47.510 --> 41:49.280
It may be the other way around.

41:55.400 --> 41:56.400
This way, please.

42:01.080 --> 42:01.540
Please.

42:04.510 --> 42:05.150
Chi Xue!

42:24.590 --> 42:25.710
Not bad, Xuanye.

42:27.270 --> 42:30.050
[Shen Tunan, owner of Xiaodongtian]

42:27.550 --> 42:29.070
As someone from the Eight Pillar Sect,

42:29.070 --> 42:30.530
you really are something.

42:30.710 --> 42:31.480
Who are you?

42:32.550 --> 42:33.230
Why did you...

42:33.230 --> 42:33.920
Why did I

42:35.030 --> 42:37.360
make a replica of your Hidden Dragon Case?

42:39.150 --> 42:40.550
Let me introduce myself.

42:40.670 --> 42:42.870
I'm Shen Tunan, owner of Xiaodongtian.

42:43.190 --> 42:44.120
Or if you prefer,

42:44.400 --> 42:45.570
you may call me…

42:46.480 --> 42:47.150
Uncle Master.
